            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/crystalline+cohomology"} crystalline cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                A. Grothendieck,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Crystals and the de Rham cohomology of schemes
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Dix exposes sur la cohomologie des schemas
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.jussieu.fr/~leila/grothendieckcircle/DixExp.pdf"} Dix exp. pdf
            %li
              %p
                P. Berthelot, A. Ogus,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Notes on crystalline cohomology
            %li
              %p
                N. Katz,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Nilpotent connections and the monodromy theorem : applications of a result of Turrittin
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=PMIHES_1970__39__175_0"} numdam
            %li
              %p
                A. Grothendieck, (EGA IV.16)
                %em Éléments de géométrie algébrique
                (rédigés avec la collaboration de Jean Dieudonné) : IV. Étude locale des schémas et des morphismes de schémas, Quatrième partie. Publications Mathématiques de l’IHÉS, 32 (1967), p. 5-361
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/numdam-bin/fitem?id=PMIHES_1967__32__5_0"} numdam
            %li
              %p SGA III, vol. 1, Expose VIIa (P. Gabriel) ETUDE INFINITESIMALE DES SCHEMAS EN GROUPES, 409-473
            %li
              %p
                wikipedia:
                %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grothendieck_connection"} Grothendieck connection
            %li
              %p
                B. Osserman,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Connections, curvature and
                    = succeed "-curvature" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi p
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.ucdavis.edu/~osserman/math/connections.pdf"} pdf
                (expositional preprint)
            %li
              %p
                A. Beilinson, I. N. Bernstein,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A proof of Jantzen conjecture
            %li
              %p
                C. Menini, D. Ştefan,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Descent theory and Amitsur cohomology of triples
                = succeed ")." do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0021-8693(03)00145-5"} doi
